msgid "游戏语言"
msgstr "Game Language"

msgid "简体中文"
msgstr "Simplified Chinese"

msgid "繁体中文"
msgstr "Traditional Chinese"

msgid "国际服请设置为繁体中文"
msgstr "Set this to Traditional Chinese for the international server."

msgid ""
"1. 自动战斗依赖按键识别，请在游戏设置中打开快捷键显示，提升出牌准确率。\n"
"2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr ""
"1. Auto battle relies on shortcut recognition. Enable shortcut display in the game settings for better accuracy.\n"
"2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

msgid ""
"1. 请主动打开游戏内自动战斗和自动剧情功能。\n"
"2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr ""
"1. Enable auto battle and auto story in the game.\n"
"2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

msgid "点击后页面一响应就继续，不再固定等待；关闭后完全恢复原版逻辑"
msgstr "Continue as soon as the page responds to a click instead of waiting a fixed time. When off, the original logic is restored."

msgid "鼠标移到目标后等待多久再点击，原版固定 0.5 秒"
msgstr "How long to hover over the target before clicking when 加速模式 is on (originally a fixed 0.5 s)."

msgid "非战斗时两次识别的最短间隔，原版 1 秒；战斗中保持 1 秒"
msgstr "Minimum interval between recognitions outside battle when 加速模式 is on (originally 1 s; stays 1 s in battle)."

msgid "关闭后商店不再点击「免费」刷新，没货就离开；开启后恢复原版刷新"
msgstr "When off, the shop's free refresh is not used and the shop is left when nothing is worth buying. When on, the original refresh behavior is restored."

msgid "保命牌（加护盾、回血）：牌名带「盾」「格挡」「壁」「治」「疗」「恢复」等字的会自动认出，这里只需补充认不出的牌；预计这回合会被打死时先出这些牌"
msgstr "Survival cards (shield or heal): cards whose names contain words like 盾, 格挡, 壁, 治, 疗 or 恢复 are recognized automatically, so only list the ones that are missed; they are played first when this turn's incoming damage would be lethal."

msgid "攻击牌拖起后先在其他敌人身上悬停看击杀预览，打得死就打它，否则打默认目标（每张牌最多多花约 1 秒）；关闭时集中打同一个敌人直到它死"
msgstr "After picking up an attack card, hover it over other enemies to read the kill preview and hit one it would kill, otherwise the default target (up to about 1 extra second per card); when off, keep attacking the same enemy until it dies."

msgid "前期收集数据用：遇到没见过的意图图标时点开怪物信息面板读出意图并记下图标，会变慢；图标收集够后关闭"
msgstr "For early data collection: when an unknown intent icon is seen, open the enemy info panel to read the intent and save the icon. Slower; turn off once enough icons are collected."

msgid "把每次出牌看到了什么、为什么这样出写进 battle_logs 目录，便于统计和排查"
msgstr "Write what was seen and why each card was played to the battle_logs folder, for statistics and troubleshooting."

msgid "出现异常（AP不足、出不掉牌、识别失败、战斗失败等）时截图，同一种异常每场战斗最多 1 张"
msgstr "Take a screenshot on anomalies (insufficient AP, a card that cannot be played, recognition failures, lost battles, etc.), at most one per kind per battle."

msgid "battle_logs 里的记录和截图保留多少天"
msgstr "How many days to keep records and screenshots in battle_logs."

msgid "battle_logs 总大小超过这个值时从最旧的文件删起"
msgstr "When battle_logs grows beyond this size, the oldest files are deleted first."
